1#issuecomment-2334504922","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/127191","id":2334504922,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAToIks6LJbfa","user":{"login":"liggitt","id":980082,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4MDA4Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/980082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/liggitt","html_url":"https://github.com/liggitt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liggitt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liggitt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liggitt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liggitt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liggitt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liggitt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liggitt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liggitt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liggitt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-09-06T17:21:42Z","updated_at":"2024-09-06T17:21:42Z","body":"doesn't this break `go test ...`? if so, we should fix this","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/comments/2334504922/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/comments/2334509417","html_url":"https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/127191#issuecomment-2334509417","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/127191","id":2334509417,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAToIks6LJclp","user":{"login":"BenTheElder","id":917931,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNzkzMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/917931?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenTheElder","html_url":"https://github.com/BenTheElder","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenTheElder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenTheElder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenTheElder/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenTheElder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenTheElder/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenTheElder/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenTheElder/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenTheElder/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenTheElder/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-09-06T17:25:01Z","updated_at":"2024-09-06T17:25:01Z","body":"> doesn't this break go test ...? if so, we should fix this\r\n\r\nI don't think so? It would break `go vet ...`, though that may already be the case if you bypass our make targets (e.g. due to nonstandard `.go-version`)\r\n\r\nIt wouldn't be great because I'm sure IDEs are running this, though again also IDEs may not currently be matching the go version.\r\n\r\nBut that's just a bit annoying? On a release branch it might be OK to not churn those and not prioritize IDE warnings.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/comments/2334509417/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/comments/2334561235","html_url":"https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/127191#issuecomment-2334561235","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/127191","id":2334561235,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAToIks6LJpPT","user":{"login":"liggitt","id":980082,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4MDA4Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/980082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/liggitt","html_url":"https://github.com/liggitt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liggitt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liggitt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liggitt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liggitt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liggitt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liggitt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liggitt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liggitt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liggitt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-09-06T17:57:35Z","updated_at":"2024-09-06T17:59:18Z","body":"> I don't think so?\r\n\r\nyeah, breaks running unit tests by default:\r\n```\r\n$ gotip test ./pkg/kubelet/pluginmanager/cache\r\n# k8s.io/kubernetes/pkg/kubelet/pluginmanager/cache\r\n# [k8s.io/kubernetes/pkg/kubelet/pluginmanager/cache]\r\npkg/kubelet/pluginmanager/cache/desired_state_of_world.go:103:20: non-constant format string in call to fmt.Errorf\r\npkg/kubelet/pluginmanager/cache/desired_state_of_world.go:111:20: non-constant format string in call to fmt.Errorf\r\npkg/kubelet/pluginmanager/cache/desired_state_of_world.go:111:43: non-constant format string in call to fmt.Errorf\r\nFAIL\tk8s.io/kubernetes/pkg/kubelet/pluginmanager/cache [build failed]\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\ngo help test\r\n...\r\nAs part of building a test binary, go test runs go vet on the package\r\nand its test source files to identify significant problems. If go vet\r\nfinds any problems, go test reports those and does not run the test\r\nbinary. Only a high-confidence subset of the default go vet checks are\r\nused. That subset is: atomic, bool, buildtags, directive, errorsas,\r\nifaceassert, nilfunc, printf, and stringintconv. You can see\r\nthe documentation for these and other vet tests via \"go doc cmd/vet\".\r\nTo disable the running of go vet, use the -vet=off flag. To run all\r\nchecks, use the -vet=all flag.\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/comments/2334561235/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":2,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/comments/2339315076","html_url":"https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/127191#issuecomment-2339315076","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/127191","id":2339315076,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAToIks6Lbx2E","user":{"login":"BenTheElder","id":917931,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNzkzMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/917931?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenTheElder","html_url":"https://github.com/BenTheElder","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenTheElder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenTheElder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenTheElder/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenTheElder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenTheElder/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenTheElder/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenTheElder/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenTheElder/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenTheElder/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-09-09T23:17:47Z","updated_at":"2024-09-09T23:17:47Z","body":"https://github.com/golang/go/issues/60529#issu